# Trial by Water (outlands 133), each status operand of Edal-Tahdal's arms alone (GM-set statuses, the rest held
# still). 109's two halves: TrialByWater_date 1 (behind) at fame level 3: available 113, completed 109; fame level 4 with
# the date ahead (2000000000): completed 113, available 109. The accepted arms at fame level 1 with the date ahead: no
# key item: available 113, completed 113, accepted 190; the fork: available 113, accepted 110, completed 113; the
# whisper: available 113, accepted 112, completed 113. The finishes read no status (GM changes while the event is open):
# 109 option 1 finished while accepted (addQuest on an accepted quest: no change; TrialByWater_date 0; the fork), 190
# finished while completed (a fork), 112 finished while available (the Eye of Nept, completed from available).
char zone=Norg pos=-13.0,1.1,-19.0 job=WAR lvl=75
